  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AHFL Access to Affordable Housing for Underserved Segments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The debt financing of the Asian Development Bank (ADB) to Aadhar Housing Finance Limited (AHFL) will support housing loans to women borrowers in economically weaker sections (EWS&apos;s) and low-income groups (LIG&apos;s). The project supports the Government of India&#x2019;s efforts to address the shortage of affordable housing units in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
